With -bytecode-hints:
C_CALL3 caml_ba_set_1 (unsafe uint16 Fortran)
C_CALL2 caml_ba_get_1 (unsafe complex32 Fortran)
C_CALL3 caml_ba_get_2 (complex64 Fortran)
GETGLOBALFIELD compilation unit Hints_link_c, 2
GETGLOBALFIELD compilation unit Hints_link_c, 1 (immediate)
C_CALL2 caml_ba_get_1 (sint8 Fortran)
PUSHGETGLOBALFIELD compilation unit Hints_link_c, 0
Without -bytecode-hints:
GETGLOBALFIELD compilation unit Hints_link_c, 2
